  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3cdrsl5X/5f0b2ecf93df1b5001c9b9d0ddb95f01a57596f2_96.webp\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches 標誌\" width=\"40\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; 一款 Complementary 著色器編輯版</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6eca16d9dd4b1b8c64f68a3f82e524a63e121d07.png\" alt=\"對比圖\"></p><div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DISCORD - white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=lightblue&amp;label=加入&amp;labelColor=white&amp;color=lightblue\">\n</a>\n\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris, oculus, optifine | 1.8.3 至最新版 - white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=lightblue&amp;label=支援&amp;labelColor=white&amp;color=lightblue\">\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17 - white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=lightblue&amp;label=贊助&amp;labelColor=white&amp;color=lightblue\">\n</a>\n</div><p><br></p><p>PixelCraft Shaders 是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 的編輯版本，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fSpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacEagle17</a> 開發，旨在重現像素藝術風格。每張截圖都是一幅全新的藝術作品！</p><p><strong>重要提示：請勿向 Emin 回報任何錯誤，聯絡資訊請見下方。</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3979faef6c57848624dcf2a0178b51c96855cd2e.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n<br>\n</a></p><h2>🔗 連結</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上贊助 SpacEagle17，即可搶先體驗預覽版本！</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a></strong>：Euphoria Patches — SpacEagle17 的主要專案！</li>\n<li>聯絡方式：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></li>\n</ul><h2>由 Ember Host 贊助</h2><p>正在尋找價格實惠且穩定可靠的 Minecraft 伺服器託管服務嗎？來看看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ember Host</strong></a>！我個人非常喜歡與他們合作——他們以極其實惠的價格提供超乎想像的價值，備受低估，且擁有出色的支援團隊。</p><p>點擊下方橫幅，您將獲得<strong>首次購買 10% 的折扣</strong>，同時還能支持 Euphoria Patches 的開發——您的首次購買金額中有 50% 將直接捐贈給開發者。或者，結帳時使用優惠碼 <strong>EUPHORIA</strong> 即可兌換折扣！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 的開發者 Emin，以及 Discord 上的所有測試者！沒有你們，這個專案將無法實現！</p>",
